        "statement": "As compensation for our live auction services, we earn a commission from both the buyer (\"buyer's premium\") and, to a lesser extent, the seller (\"seller's commission\") (collectively, \"auction commission revenue\"), both of which are typically calculated as a percentage of the hammer (sale) price of the vehicle sold at auction.",
